<div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Your ambition. A clearer direction.</div><h1>Your next chapter<br>starts with <span class="serif">a path.</span></h1><p class="lead">Turn “where do I start?” into work you’re proud to share. Practical learning, thoughtful feedback, and a little momentum toward your first internship.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/programmes">Explore your path<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="/schools">Bring DualPath to your students<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><p class="tiny">For high school and college students. Built around doing.</p></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of learning, practice, and a finished work sample"><div class="art-grid"></div><div class="orbit"></div><div class="orbit small"></div><svg class="hero-path" viewBox="0 0 500 510" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M100 90C-50 180 480 125 390 300S80 270 130 450" fill="none" stroke="#7296c4" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/></svg><div class="art-label">SMALL STEPS. TANGIBLE PROGRESS.</div><div class="art-dot"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></div><div class="art-card first"><div class="flex"><div class="mini-icon"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h6q3 0 3 3v14q0-3-3-3H3zM21 4h-6q-3 0-3 3v14q0-3 3-3h6z"/></svg></div><div><h4>Learn with intention.</h4><p>Five modules + personal practice</p></div></div><div class="micro-progress"><span style="width:70%"></span></div></div><div class="art-card second"><div class="flex"><div class="mini-icon" style="background:#d7eaff"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 16 12-12 4 4L8 20H4zM13 7l4 4"/></svg></div><div><h4>Put it into practice.</h4><p>A first draft. Real feedback. A next step.</p></div></div><div class="line-item"><span>Your outreach brief</span><span class="badge ">Ready to review</span></div></div><div class="art-card third"><div class="flex"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg><div><h4>Leave with proof.</h4><p>Work you can confidently share</p></div><span class="badge ">Yours</span></div></div><div class="art-stamp">ILLUSTRATIVE LEARNING JOURNEY</div></div></section><div class="strip"><div><b>Less guesswork.<br>More forward motion.</b></div><div><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h6q3 0 3 3v14q0-3-3-3H3zM21 4h-6q-3 0-3 3v14q0-3 3-3h6z"/></svg><b>Learn the essentials</b><span class="muted">Five core modules, plus optional practice</span></div><div><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 16 12-12 4 4L8 20H4zM13 7l4 4"/></svg><b>Make something real</b><span class="muted">Practical work, not just checkboxes</span></div><div><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h18v14H8l-5 4zM7 8h10M7 12h7"/></svg><b>Find your next step</b><span class="muted">Feedback and a plan to move forward</span></div></div><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Two ways forward</div><h2>A little structure.<br>A lot of possibility.</h2></div><p>Start your own journey, or bring a whole cohort along. The work stays personal.</p></div><div class="grid2"><article class="path-choice dark"><div class="eyebrow">For students</div><h3>Build confidence.<br>One useful skill at a time.</h3><p>Learn the fundamentals, practise on real tasks, and turn your effort into a portfolio of proof.</p><a class="text-link" href="/programme">Meet your learning path<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><span class="path-number">01</span></article><article class="path-choice light"><div class="eyebrow">For schools & colleges</div><h3>Give every student<br>a clearer starting point.</h3><p>Run a purposeful cohort, support the students who need you, and see progress beyond attendance.</p><a class="text-link" href="/schools">Explore institutional programmes<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><span class="path-number">02</span></article></div></section><section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">The curriculum</div><h2>Skills for the door.<br>Confidence to knock.</h2></div><p>Five core modules take you from building a habit to making a thoughtful ask. Personalised practice adds another way to reflect and improve.</p></div><div class="module-rows"><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">01 /</span><h3>Discipline & ownership</h3><p>Build a rhythm you can rely on.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">02 /</span><h3>Cold email fundamentals</h3><p>Start a conversation that opens a door.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">03 /</span><h3>Resume & portfolio proof</h3><p>Make your work speak for you.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">04 /</span><h3>Networking & relationships</h3><p>Build connections, thoughtfully.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">05 /</span><h3>Interviewing & negotiation</h3><p>Tell your story with confidence.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a href="/programme" class="module-row"><span class="num">06 /</span><h3>Personalized practice</h3><p>A little more practice, where it counts.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div></section><section class="feature-band"><div><div class="eyebrow">More than a completion badge</div><h2>Don’t just learn it.<br><span class="serif">Have something to show.</span></h2><p>Each step brings learning into the real world: a sharper resume, a thoughtful outreach message, a project story that sounds like you.</p><a class="btn sky" href="/dashboard">Open your student workspace<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="sample-sheet"><div class="between"><span class="eyebrow" style="margin:0">Your proof portfolio</span><span class="badge ">Illustrative</span></div><div class="divider"></div><h4>A clearer story, in your own words.</h4><p class="tiny muted">A collection that grows as you do.</p><div class="line-item"><span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2h9l5 5v15H5zM14 2v6h5M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg> &nbsp; Resume & project story</span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg></div><div class="line-item"><span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3zM3 5l9 8 9-8"/></svg> &nbsp; A researched outreach brief</span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg></div><div class="line-item"><span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h18v14H8l-5 4zM7 8h10M7 12h7"/></svg> &nbsp; Interview practice notes</span><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></sv